  "text": "This simple search trick in Gmail rounds up every promotional newsletter for one-click removal. Waking up to hundreds of promotional blasts creates morning anxiety and hides urgent priority communications. Manually clicking tiny unsubscribe links at the bottom of every message wastes hours every single week. Instead, search unsubscribe in Gmail, select matching conversations, and create an automated rule to archive them. You maintain a spotless inbox effortlessly.",
